{
  "description": "Workspace `port` file: `PORT` on the first line, an optional NONCE on the second. Strict: the port is ASCII digits only (no sign, no whitespace) in 1..=65535 and must be the first line; anything else on that line makes the content invalid. The nonce line is trimmed. `port` is null when the content is invalid. Both parsers agree on every case; read by beamtalk_workspace::parse_port_file (Rust) and parsePortFileContent in editors/vscode/src/workspaceClient.ts (TypeScript).",
